docs {
  # Ai
  
  Machine endpoints for Externa AI (HMAC), not Public CMS Bearer auth and not session Admin packs.
  
  ## Collection import webhook
  
  `POST /ai/webhooks/collection-import` — CSRF-exempt; signed with `AI_WEBHOOK_TOKEN`.
  
  Header: `X-AI-Webhook-Signature: sha256=` + HMAC-SHA256(**raw body**, token).
  
  Rotate the token with `php artisan ai:rotate-webhook-token` (#207). During `--grace=…` both current and previous tokens verify until `AI_WEBHOOK_TOKEN_PREVIOUS_EXPIRES_AT`.
  
  Env (collection `.env`):
  
  | Variable | Purpose |
  |----------|---------|
  | `EXTERNA_AI_WEBHOOK_TOKEN` | Current HMAC secret → Bruno `ai_webhook_token` |
}
